        "description": "Entering the /bPassion//b state grants Jane one use of Basic Attack:\n\nSalchow Jump. When available, hold [BASIC] to activate: Launch rapid consecutive attacks forward, followed by a finishing strike, dealing Physical DMG. Hold the button during the continuous attacks to extend the skill duration.\n\nRelease [BASIC] to trigger the finishing strike early. Anti-Interrupt level is increased during the continuous attacks, and Jane takes 40% reduced DMG. Jane is invulnerable during the finishing strike. Using /bBasic Attack: Salchow Jump//b while in the /bPassion//b state generates /bPassion Stream//b.",
